<title>USA: Park Ridge, N.J., won by First Union.</title>
<headline>Park Ridge, N.J., won by First Union.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets said it won $2.930 million of Park Ridge, N.J., general improvement bonds, with a lowest rate of 4.55, highest price of 100.1718.</p>
</text>
